# Version branches

- `master` is Minecraft **26.2**. All current Fabric work happens here.
- `1.20.1` is the **1.20.1** port. Do not implement that port unless asked.
- Never merge `master` and `1.20.1` into each other. APIs differ; cherry-pick or re-implement shared logic.
- New game versions get a branch named after the version (`1.21.1`, `26.2`, …). The newest line stays on `master`.
- When working on a version branch, only change that branch's loader, mappings, and Fabric API.
